          merged.
          
          Use `jj op log` to find the operation ID you want. Any unambiguous prefix of the
          operation ID is enough.
          
          When loading the repo at an earlier operation, the working copy will be ignored, as
          if `--ignore-working-copy` had been specified.
          
          It is possible to run mutating commands when loading the repo at an earlier
          operation. Doing that is equivalent to having run concurrent commands starting at
